{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategic incremental clicker set in Roman times. Clicks. Improvements. Resources. But above all, a volcano on the verge of eruption, sending waves of monsters for you to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/7f50834835ce9e240c81be918f5d2dc5.avif?t=1769245315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras_big/7f50834835ce9e240c81be918f5d2dc5.avif?t=1769245315 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/eec71728c5affeccbac7fdc777abc8db.poster.avif?t=1769245315\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/eec71728c5affeccbac7fdc777abc8db.webm?t=1769245315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/eec71728c5affeccbac7fdc777abc8db.mp4?t=1769245315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood, Rock, Water, every natural ressource is collectable. Just click on it to create blocks of it. The click on the block to send it on your storage !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/ae002069512d89245c0bead6a85a7601.avif?t=1769245315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras_big/ae002069512d89245c0bead6a85a7601.avif?t=1769245315 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/f401a0b76798c63d1815a7835ddd29f5.poster.avif?t=1769245315\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/f401a0b76798c63d1815a7835ddd29f5.webm?t=1769245315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/f401a0b76798c63d1815a7835ddd29f5.mp4?t=1769245315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking to collect ressource can be very tedious. Create some Cracker and Grabbers to help you on you task. And manage them to collect specific ressources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/db47b9cde7ebfb6d56435fb29acb0c96.avif?t=1769245315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras_big/db47b9cde7ebfb6d56435fb29acb0c96.avif?t=1769245315 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/83ecc3b185e4bfd0638eeae154c85b31.poster.avif?t=1769245315\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/83ecc3b185e4bfd0638eeae154c85b31.webm?t=1769245315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/83ecc3b185e4bfd0638eeae154c85b31.mp4?t=1769245315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you gather ressources, the more you can create new buildings. Buildings can do multiple things : combine ressources, get gifts from the gods, create military units to defend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/a71bbca8106f620624c4bd861f84862f.avif?t=1769245315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras_big/a71bbca8106f620624c4bd861f84862f.avif?t=1769245315 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/ec284339dcd7eedc6eb69389abe5246b.poster.avif?t=1769245315\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/ec284339dcd7eedc6eb69389abe5246b.webm?t=1769245315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/extras/ec284339dcd7eedc6eb69389abe5246b.mp4?t=1769245315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use all your ressources to buy multiples upgrades. Improve the productivity of your Grabbers, or unlock new abilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581960?t=1769245315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/3d4e87b285b5b224b89300ac2e73a81604e54e32/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769245315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/4a1d0e122de3d70a225e805fd45c27eb3b7ad918/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769245315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581960/4a1d0e122de3d70a225e805fd45c27eb3b7ad918/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17692